---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About moonine - Philosophy of Vedic Astrology Matchmaking" description="Learn how moonine uses the traditional 36-point Ashta Koota system, Guna Milan, and planetary alignments to help you find your celestial partner.">
    <style>
        .guide-section {
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
        .guide-section h1 {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: none;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-family: var(--font-secondary);
            font-size: var(--font-3xl);
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .guide-section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: none;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--bumble-text);
            font-family: var(--font-secondary);
            font-size: var(--font-2xl);
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .step-card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 2px solid var(--bumble-border);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(143,118,99,0.01);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .step-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--bumble-yellow);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .tagline {
            display: block;
            font-size: var(--font-xs);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--bumble-text-light);
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }
        .step-number {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background: var(--bumble-yellow);
            color: var(--bumble-text);
            border: 2px solid var(--bumble-yellow);
            border-radius: 50%;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-right: 0.75rem;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--bumble-yellow);
        }
        .contact-box {
            background: var(--bumble-cream);
            border: 2px dashed var(--bumble-yellow);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .contact-link {
            color: #b59a83;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .contact-link:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
    </style>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h1>The moonine Philosophy</h1>
        <p style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: var(--bumble-text-light); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;">Vedic Wisdom, Modern Connections</p>
        <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: var(--font-base); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 650px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
            We bridge the gap between ancient Vedic compatibility and modern matchmaking. By rejecting casual swipes and superficial listings, moonine is a trustworthy haven for those seeking genuine, lifelong alignment.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Why moonine?</h2>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">🌟 Celestial Harmony, Deeply Calculated</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Ashta Koota Matching:</strong>
                Every match undergoes high-precision 36-point Guna Milan, evaluating Varna, Nadi, and Gana for genuine spiritual and physiological compatibility. We also automatically detect and explain key Doshas (like Nadi and Bhakoot Dosha) to ensure lasting harmony.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">🛡️ Genuine, Gracious & Secure</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Polite Human Verification:</strong>
                To protect your peace and privacy, we reject automated bots and casual browsers. Every profile is manually vetted, and introductions are facilitated politely and securely.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Our Simple 3-Step Journey</h2>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">✨ Step 1: Discover Alignment</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <span class="step-number">1</span>
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Explore Profiles:</strong>
                Browse verified profiles with high-compatibility scores and explore mutual astrological benefits.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">📬 Step 2: Express Interest Safely</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <span class="step-number">2</span>
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Send an Email:</strong>
                Simply email the User ID of your preferred profile to our primary contact, Rahul Bali, at <a href="mailto:rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com" style="color: var(--bumble-text); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: underline;">rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">🤝 Step 3: Gentle Introduction</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <span class="step-number">3</span>
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Mutual Choice:</strong>
                We politely verify interest with the other party. We coordinate a secure introduction only after mutual consent.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>A Trustworthy Experience</h2>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">🔑 Simple & Reliable Security</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Secure Logins:</strong>
                Your profile is protected by your 10-digit mobile number and a private 4-digit PIN, avoiding fragile browser-only cookies while keeping access straightforward and secure.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">⏳ Mindful & Precise Math</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Calculations Latency:</strong>
                Determining true Kundli planetary degrees and 36-point compatibility requires robust mathematical computing, which may result in a brief calculation delay. We appreciate your mindful patience.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div class="contact-box">
            <p style="font-size: var(--font-lg); font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em;">Ready to find your celestial alignment?</p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--bumble-text); line-height: 1.5;">
                Join a polite, values-driven community today. For inquiries or custom assistance, feel free to contact <strong style="font-weight: 800;">Rahul Bali</strong> at <a href="mailto:rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com" class="contact-link">rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>
            <a href="/create-profile" style="display: inline-block; background: var(--bumble-yellow); color: var(--bumble-text); padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid var(--bumble-yellow); box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--bumble-yellow); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">👉 Create Profile & View Matches</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;">
        <div class="logo logo-sm" data-text="moonine" style="margin-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;"><span class="logo-text" style="color: var(--bumble-text);">moonine</span></div>
    </div>

</Layout>
